          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><em>\"I'd been searching for a turquoise ring that felt truly special, and this piece is exactly that. Beautiful, substantial, and perfectly balanced.\"</em></p><p><em>     -Lisa</em></p><p><em>\"The Royston turquoise is beautiful, and the handmade silver chain is incredible. This necklace feels truly unique and timeless.”</em></p><p><em>     -Annabeth</em></p><p><em>\"This is one of the most beautiful pieces I've ever worn. It feels like a piece of art, and I'm already enjoying it so much.\"</em></p><p><em>     -Katie</em></p><p><em>\"I ABSOLUTELY love her. She is gorgeous. You totally killed it and got just what I wanted it to be.\"</em></p><p><em>    - Nicci</em></p>",
